       "spans": [
        {
         "text": "Both the left and right posterior insula were associated with the ADS-lbc (cluster-wise p = .001 [left], .0001 [right]), followed by the PCC (cluster-wise p = .0004) and the left superior frontal gyrus (cluster-wise p = .05).",
